{"3649590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "run for money Hunter vs. Runner! Which side will you win!?", "steam_appid": 3649590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649590/extras/98dd59fa8db575079cc67a19cd263569.avif?t=1783389079\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hit series with 1.5 million units sold returns to after 7 years!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This edition adds “Hunter Mode,” where you capture runners!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience your very own &quot;Run for Money&quot;!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an action-packed escape game based on the rules of Japanese television programs popular show “Run for Money”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players become runner, constantly evading pursuers released within a limited area, and win money based on how long they manage to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649590/extras/f5d818388237739e92bacf0ea307ce3d.avif?t=1783389079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649590/extras/7044b5de8e34f46bf31ec18837a1a3d5.avif?t=1783389079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This installment marks the series' first inclusion of “Hunter Mode,” where you become a hunter and aim to become the strongest hunter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only can you play as a runner escaping from hunters, you can also become a hunter and capture the runners!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649590/extras/6c6a07cd901d7f6a89405da0b05bec2f.avif?t=1783389079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649590/extras/0b5b93994f769b61e4aefd0610779aef.avif?t=1783389079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This edition features five original stages: “Wonderland,” “Airport,” “Harbor,” “Fantasy,” and “Diver City.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like in the TV show, runners will face a variety of missions during each stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear all the mission and aim to make a successful escape!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649590/extras/48bb2ea7f645128c7602b58bca4006c0.avif?t=1783389079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649590/extras/5e18b7728ccc2de3911cf9df00503933.avif?t=1783389079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649590/extras_big/5e18b7728ccc2de3911cf9df00503933.avif?t=1783389079 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In online battles, the new &quot;Hunter VS Runaway Mode&quot; lets up to 12 players (4 Hunters, 8 Runaways) face off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's all have a blast playing Run for Money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649590/extras/f406adc8c4c854d94f93bde8d318b0b7.avif?t=1783389079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p c