878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649590/extras/0b5b93994f769b61e4aefd0610779aef.avif?t=1783389079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This edition features five original stages: “Wonderland,” “Airport,” “Harbor,” “Fantasy,” and “Diver City.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like in the TV show, runners will face a variety of missions during each stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear all the mission and aim to make a successful escape!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649590/extras/48bb2ea7f645128c7602b58bca4006c0.avif?t=1783389079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649590/extras/5e18b7728ccc2de3911cf9df00503933.avif?t=1783389079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649590/extras_big/5e18b7728ccc2de3911cf9df00503933.avif?t=1783389079 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In online battles, the new &quot;Hunter VS Runaway Mode&quot; lets up to 12 players (4 Hunters, 8 Runaways) face off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's all have a blast playing Run for Money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649590/extras/f406adc8c4c854d94f93bde8d318b0b7.avif?t=1783389079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The game &quot;Run for Money&quot;: Hunter VS Runner! Which Side Will You Win With!? is an action game that follows the rules of the popular